# The landlady calls for the name on the ID card. You give your own name.
# "friend" is a buried clue (pin); the friend lie is accepted. Keep the stay/go goodbye contrast.
# Each <id>-alt<n> uses only words met by then; its -answer is answered in character.

call = 민준 씨? 민준 씨!
call-reply = { $player }입니다.

friend = 민준 씨 친구예요?
friend-reply = { $player }입니다.
friend-alt1 = 친구예요.
friend-alt1-answer = 친구……

bye = 안녕히 계세요.
bye-reply = 안녕히 가세요.
bye-alt1 = 민준 씨?
bye-alt1-answer = 민준 씨……
bye-alt2 = 친구예요?
bye-alt2-answer = 친구? 안녕히 계세요.
